{"mode":"words","text":"If you just memorize vocabulary lists, you’re not actually learning a language. On this page, you’ll see firsthand how things feel different in just a few seconds: The sample text above is a real, interactive app interface, and a native-speaker-quality voice will read this explanation aloud to you right away while the words light up. With LinguaFlow, you learn languages the way your brain prefers: first understand, then listen, then speak. The method behind it is inspired by the Birkenbihl Method and consists of four steps: decoding, active listening, passive listening, and practice. Give it a try—tap a word above.","words":[{"s":0,"e":163},{"s":232,"e":325},{"s":441,"e":685},{"s":801,"e":1370},{"s":1416,"e":2183},{"s":2241,"e":2670},{"s":2763,"e":2984},{"s":3030,"e":3170},{"s":3239,"e":3704},{"s":3762,"e":4098},{"s":4156,"e":4191},{"s":4261,"e":4992},{"s":5306,"e":5515},{"s":5573,"e":5724},{"s":5793,"e":6153},{"s":6188,"e":6420},{"s":6478,"e":6653},{"s":6769,"e":7477},{"s":7570,"e":7767},{"s":7848,"e":8104},{"s":8162,"e":8406},{"s":8499,"e":8986},{"s":9067,"e":9195},{"s":9253,"e":9450},{"s":9485,"e":9508},{"s":9578,"e":9752},{"s":9810,"e":10553},{"s":11819,"e":11947},{"s":12016,"e":12423},{"s":12481,"e":12841},{"s":12875,"e":13270},{"s":13317,"e":13479},{"s":13537,"e":13572},{"s":13688,"e":14129},{"s":14176,"e":14896},{"s":14965,"e":15244},{"s":15325,"e":16207},{"s":16521,"e":16811},{"s":16892,"e":16927},{"s":17043,"e":18425},{"s":18495,"e":18843},{"s":18901,"e":19122},{"s":19203,"e":19435},{"s":19481,"e":19632},{"s":19748,"e":20573},{"s":20642,"e":21049},{"s":21084,"e":21142},{"s":21211,"e":21316},{"s":21432,"e":21664},{"s":21699,"e":22047},{"s":22163,"e":22465},{"s":22500,"e":22570},{"s":22639,"e":23069},{"s":23220,"e":23487},{"s":23557,"e":23963},{"s":25228,"e":25426},{"s":25495,"e":26262},{"s":26436,"e":26540},{"s":26633,"e":26842},{"s":26912,"e":27411},{"s":27469,"e":27539},{"s":27585,"e":27713},{"s":27771,"e":27910},{"s":27957,"e":2817